in":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-25T17:56:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T17:56:14Z","body":"After more testing, it looks like—for the editor help pages and the inspector—the issue only occurs when using \"Follow System Theme\" and the system theme changes from outside (similar to #104339).\nAre you able to confirm this on your side?\n\nScene tabs seem to have the issue even when changing theme from within the editor.\n\nI believe the problem (aside from scene tabs) is that `NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED` triggers this whole sequence:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/923c751af4e35fe8ef5f24d72333a561030f7382/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1087-L1092\nWhile `_check_system_theme_changed` only makes the one call:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/923c751af4e35fe8ef5f24d72333a561030f7382/editor/editor_node.cpp#L3992-L3994\n\nWould it be more correct to move some/all of that procedure into `_update_theme` to avoid this kind of bug in the future, or is it better to just replicate it in `_check_system_theme_changed`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3960993322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]